      <Comment source="pmngroup">This enzyme has methylesterase activity against methyl salicylate (MeSA) &lt;i&gt;in vitro&lt;/i&gt; but its biological activity &lt;i&gt;in vivo&lt;/i&gt; has not been determined |CITS: [18643994][18467465]|. It also has some activity against MeIAA &lt;i&gt;in vitro&lt;/i&gt;, but only about 30% of the activity it shows against MeSA |CITS: [18643994]|.</Comment>
