      <Comment source="pmngroup">This enzyme has methylesterase activity against methyl indole-3-acetate (MeIAA), methyl salicylate (MeSA), and methyl jasmonate (MeJA) &lt;i&gt;in vitro&lt;/i&gt; but its biological activity &lt;i&gt;in vivo&lt;/i&gt; has not been determined |CITS: [18467465]|. It has a much higher affinity for MeSA than for MeJA and MeIAA &lt;i&gt;in vitro&lt;/i&gt; |CITS: [18643994]|.</Comment>
